# deml-ui — Cursor rules

This repo is the DEML design system: **new-from-the-start (warm ash)**.

## Look (mandatory)

- Warm ash grounds (`#35312D` / `#1C1916`), cream modules (`#F3F0EA`), primary `#2F5F8F`
- **Geist only** for all type roles (display, intro, body) — do not add Syne/Fraunces
- 8px grid, dual `data-theme`, equal `--tile-gap`, fluid dash-rows (`minmax(--tile-row-unit, auto)`)
- Fixed `--chart-aspect: 2.4` — never squash or stretch plots
- Sharp modules (`--radius-*: 0`) unless a control needs the pill radius

## Do

- Change visuals in `components/<name>/` and `styles/tokens.css` / `styles/base.css`
- Expand from this warm-ash NFTS system — do not mix cold seven-color or Viking chrome
- Run `npm run sync` after adding/removing component folders; `npm run build` before release
- Prefer WCAG 2.0 AA patterns already used in base + headless primitives

## Do not

- Reintroduce Viking-UI naming, void-black / electric `#2176ff`, or `--viking-*` tokens
- Replace warm ash with arbitrary seven-color locks (`#0066B2` / `#121212` / `#FFFFFF` suite) that fight NFTS
- Hand-edit generated wrappers under `src/angular/markup/` or `generated/` — regenerate via sync
- Use fixed `grid-auto-rows: var(--dash-row)` without `minmax(..., auto)` (squashes charts/tiles)
- Invent one-off spacing outside the token scale

Consumer guidance: deml `THEME.md` / `AGENTS.md`.
